        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana TC80, Solid Brass Transom Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTransom catches are used for small windows or doors including cabinet doors. The solid brass construction of this Transom Catch makes it ideal for marine and boat applications. Also used in buildings and motor homes. For a wide range of installation types, it comes packaged with 3 different type strikes: box strike, angled strike and universal strike. Includes solid brass, matching finish, philips drive flat-head #7 x 3/4 inch wood screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-TC80_size.gif?v=1704354590\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana TC80 Transom Catch size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana TC80 Transom Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Total Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Throw: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Brass Screws: #7 x 3/4\" Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TC80.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana TC80 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Transom Catch | Deltana TC80",
                "description": "Transom Catch Deltana TC80 - Transom catches are used for small windows or doors including cabinet doors. The solid brass construction of this Transom Catch makes it ideal for marine and boat applications. Also used in buildings and motor homes. For a wide range of installation types, it comes packaged with 3 different type strikes: box strike, angled strike and universal strike. Includes solid brass, matching finish, philips drive flat-head #7 x 3/4 inch wood screws.\r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-TC80 Solid Brass Transom Catch, Deltana TC80 Transom Catches, Cabinet Locks, cabinet latches, surface mounted cabinet locks, brass cabinet latches, window catches, window locks, marine cabinet catches, marine cabinet locks, boat cabinet latches, boat  cabinet catches, marine cabinet locks, boat  cabinet latches, DEL-TC80U3, DEL-TC80U5, DEL-TC80U10B, DEL-TC80U15, DEL-TC80U15A, DEL-TC80U19, DEL-TC80U26, DEL-TC80U26D,"
